{"id":"velodyssee-bordeaux-hendaye","title":"La Vélodyssée: Bordeaux to San Sebastián","who":"Classic route · EuroVelo 1 along the Atlantic","when":"May to October","vehicle":"Any bike, 6–9 days","kind":"bike","color":"#0891b2","summary":"From Bordeaux's wine country to the coast at Lacanau, then south on traffic-free paths through the pine forests of the Landes behind the surf beaches, past the Dune du Pilat, to Biarritz, Saint-Jean-de-Luz and over the border to San Sebastián. Flat, well signed, and EuroVelo-certified since 2024.","sources":[{"label":"La Vélodyssée: 2025 press kit","url":"https://www.lavelodyssee.com/sites/velodyssee/files/inline-files/DP-2025-la-velodyssee.pdf"},{"label":"Tourisme Landes: La Vélodyssée in the Landes","url":"https://www.tourismelandes.com/?p=78151"}],"approximate":"Main stops; the line follows cycle paths near the coast.","km":353,"bbox":[-1.9839,43.3147,-0.58,45.0075],"stops":[{"name":"Bordeaux","place":"Bordeaux, France","at":[44.8412,-0.58],"text":"The Place de la Bourse and its water mirror.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Bordeaux_place_de_la_bourse_with_tram.JPG/500px-Bordeaux_place_de_la_bourse_with_tram.JPG","page":"Bordeaux","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bordeaux_place_de_la_bourse_with_tram.JPG","credit":"Phillip Maiwald (Nikopol)","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"Lacanau","place":"Lacanau-Océan","at":[45.0015,-1.1963],"text":"A forest cycle path to the surf coast.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Lacanau-ocean_plage_2013%2805%29.JPG/500px-Lacanau-ocean_plage_2013%2805%29.JPG","page":"Lacanau","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lacanau-ocean_plage_2013%2805%29.JPG","credit":"Azotte","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"Arcachon","place":"Arcachon, France","at":[44.6616,-1.17],"text":"The oyster bay and Europe's tallest sand dune.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d